WEBVTT

01:36.610 --> 01:39.970
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.080 --> 01:41.979
[Episode 24]

01:42.120 --> 01:45.140
[eWorld, Zhongguancun]

01:45.500 --> 01:46.150
Hey.

01:46.430 --> 01:47.020
Hey.

01:47.039 --> 01:48.289
Why did you stop me?

01:48.320 --> 01:49.270
We're delivery riders,

01:49.270 --> 01:50.390
not an F1 racing team.

01:50.390 --> 01:51.830
They're obviously picking on us.

01:52.070 --> 01:52.950
Wanghe isn't here right now.

01:52.950 --> 01:53.820
Whatever we say won't make a difference.

01:53.860 --> 01:55.030
Let's just listen to whatever they have to say.

01:55.050 --> 01:56.670
We'll figure something out when he gets back.

01:56.950 --> 01:58.270
But we can't give them something to hold against us.

01:58.270 --> 01:59.070
I said we'll think about it.

01:59.070 --> 02:00.430
I didn't say we'd definitely come up with a solution.

02:00.450 --> 02:02.450
You've been coding so much that your brain's stopped working.

02:07.750 --> 02:09.400
Let's give Wanghe a call first.

02:09.419 --> 02:10.389
Let him know what's going on.

02:20.230 --> 02:20.970
Where are you?

02:21.340 --> 02:22.200
In the hospital room.

02:23.340 --> 02:24.390
How's Uncle Xie doing?

02:27.220 --> 02:28.470
He got a few stitches.

02:30.350 --> 02:31.250
It's nothing serious.

02:31.550 --> 02:33.350
He'll be discharged after a couple more days of observation.

02:33.910 --> 02:34.710
How are you guys doing?

02:37.329 --> 02:38.940
Song is really picking a fight.

02:39.079 --> 02:40.130
We'll hold out for now.

02:41.070 --> 02:41.870
We'll let you know if we can't handle it anymore.

02:42.079 --> 02:42.710
Alright.

02:43.810 --> 02:44.970
Before I get back,

02:44.990 --> 02:46.350
don't make any decisions.

02:46.590 --> 02:47.730
We'll discuss it when I return.

02:47.860 --> 02:48.500
Okay.

02:49.590 --> 02:50.860
Then on behalf of me and Haikuo,

02:50.860 --> 02:52.150
give our regards to your dad.

02:52.650 --> 02:53.110
I'm hanging up.

02:55.660 --> 02:56.820
I'm fine here.

02:57.350 --> 02:59.079
If you're busy, you can go back.

03:02.850 --> 03:03.940
I'm not busy.

03:04.510 --> 03:05.590
I'm really fine here.

03:05.590 --> 03:06.630
Your mom's here too.

03:06.630 --> 03:07.510
Don't worry.

03:08.990 --> 03:10.270
Don't say that.

03:10.670 --> 03:12.210
I've finally managed to come visit.

03:12.390 --> 03:13.510
Let me fulfill my filial duty.

03:14.380 --> 03:15.310
Filial duty?

03:17.990 --> 03:18.730
Don't move.

03:23.560 --> 03:25.290
If you really want to be filial,

03:25.820 --> 03:28.360
hurry up and give me a grandson.

03:33.220 --> 03:34.230
Stop pretending to be busy.

03:34.260 --> 03:35.370
It's your own business.

03:35.470 --> 03:36.190
Hey.

03:37.190 --> 03:38.720
Fine, I'm pretending to be busy.

03:39.079 --> 03:40.220
Only you are truly busy.

03:45.190 --> 03:47.720
Even Liang has a daughter now.

03:48.030 --> 03:49.590
You're comparing me to him?

03:51.200 --> 03:52.360
He's making good money too.

03:52.590 --> 03:53.860
He opened a farm.

03:54.020 --> 03:55.110
He says his crayfish

03:55.140 --> 03:57.760
is being sold in Beijing and Shanghai now.

03:57.790 --> 04:00.070
Right? He's successful in his career

04:00.490 --> 04:01.790
and has a harmonious family.

04:02.190 --> 04:03.230
Harmonious?

04:04.280 --> 04:05.730
I heard that

04:06.000 --> 04:07.790
this Liang did something bad.

04:07.950 --> 04:09.600
His wife caught him cheating.

04:09.620 --> 04:11.020
His nose was even broken.

04:11.260 --> 04:12.510
You, you...

04:13.110 --> 04:13.910
Stop talking nonsense.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.440
Go find a girlfriend quickly.

04:15.660 --> 04:16.600
No time.

04:21.029 --> 04:22.920
If you really don't have time,

04:23.720 --> 04:25.540
finding someone who's already available is fine too.

04:34.050 --> 04:34.680
Hello?

04:34.710 --> 04:36.240
Fenghua, where are you?

04:36.270 --> 04:37.090
Tianjin.

04:37.370 --> 04:37.940
What's wrong?

04:38.360 --> 04:40.330
My mom fell while working.

04:40.720 --> 04:47.360
[Nurse Station]

04:41.330 --> 04:42.250
Is she okay?

04:42.430 --> 04:44.060
I don't know. She's in the hospital.

04:44.720 --> 04:45.470
They said

04:45.490 --> 04:46.420
she needs to do a CT scan.

04:46.450 --> 04:47.120
Fenghua,

04:48.580 --> 04:50.190
can you lend me some money?

04:50.140 --> 04:52.780
[Nurse Station]

04:50.750 --> 04:51.510
How much do you need?

04:51.830 --> 04:52.840
Is 5,000 okay?

04:52.860 --> 04:53.790
I have some money on me,

04:53.810 --> 04:56.070
but I'm afraid it's not enough.

04:56.010 --> 05:01.930
[Nurse Station]

04:56.100 --> 04:58.210
No problem, I'll transfer it to you right away.

05:02.070 --> 05:03.340
[Transfer amount: 5,000 yuan]

05:03.440 --> 05:04.300
[WeChat Pay]

05:04.350 --> 05:08.570
[Nurse Station]

05:08.100 --> 05:08.940
Aunt Liang.

05:09.670 --> 05:10.670
Did something come up?

05:11.020 --> 05:11.910
It's nothing.

05:11.950 --> 05:13.400
If you have something to do, you should go back first.

05:13.430 --> 05:14.800
I know you're busy.

05:15.400 --> 05:17.940
Uncle Xie appreciates your thoughtfulness.

05:18.270 --> 05:19.540
When he is discharged from the hospital,

05:19.650 --> 05:21.100
we'll go to Beijing together.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.460
We'll have a meal together then.

05:23.510 --> 05:24.470
Alright.

05:24.660 --> 05:26.100
I'll just say goodbye to him then.

05:26.250 --> 05:26.950
Okay.

05:28.100 --> 05:30.400
I know you're all working very hard in Beijing.

05:30.430 --> 05:31.710
Tell him.

05:32.020 --> 05:32.909
He can understand.

05:32.930 --> 05:33.760
Besides,

05:33.950 --> 05:35.280
I'm here.

05:39.430 --> 05:40.990
Drive the car back.

05:41.010 --> 05:42.150
Give it to Xingchi.

05:42.170 --> 05:44.540
They need to do some intense street canvassing these days.

05:44.560 --> 05:45.570
They could use it.

05:50.680 --> 05:51.700
You...

05:52.960 --> 05:53.950
didn't get much sleep yesterday.

05:53.980 --> 05:55.300
Do you want to take a nap before you leave?

05:55.460 --> 05:56.220
No need.

05:56.810 --> 05:58.659
I'm worried about you driving while fatigued.

05:59.300 --> 06:00.970
It's just the beginning.

06:01.110 --> 06:01.870
During the 11/11 Sale,

06:01.870 --> 06:04.000
I worked for 72 hours straight without any problem.

06:04.020 --> 06:04.780
I'm off.

06:05.730 --> 06:07.770
Go to the rest area if you're sleepy.

06:30.960 --> 06:32.190
Don't you know

06:32.190 --> 06:33.540
how Fenghua treats you?

06:33.560 --> 06:34.920
Don't play dumb here.

06:35.830 --> 06:37.790
Fenghua and I are like brothers.

06:37.810 --> 06:38.610
Blood-related.

06:38.630 --> 06:39.230
Get out.

06:42.480 --> 06:43.680
Brothers?

06:46.100 --> 06:47.830
Fenghua is a girl.

06:47.860 --> 06:50.240
She doesn't have big ambitions,

06:50.390 --> 06:53.300
but under such a fierce competition in Beijing,

06:53.320 --> 06:55.200
she still endured it 'till now.

06:55.230 --> 06:56.950
Don't you understand?

06:57.780 --> 06:58.990
Isn't it all for you?

06:58.990 --> 07:01.550
Don't play dumb here.

07:01.900 --> 07:03.320
What am I playing dumb about?

07:03.350 --> 07:04.930
If you don't understand, don't talk nonsense.

07:07.940 --> 07:08.770
Last year,

07:09.840 --> 07:12.190
when her family was renovating,

07:12.290 --> 07:13.560
Lao'er

07:13.710 --> 07:15.650
found a diary

07:15.730 --> 07:17.630
under Fenghua's bed.

07:18.380 --> 07:20.140
It was all about you.

07:22.190 --> 07:23.130
This proves

07:23.190 --> 07:24.430
that Fenghua likes you

07:24.450 --> 07:26.450
and it's not something that just happened recently.

07:27.810 --> 07:29.420
If it wasn't for you,

07:29.530 --> 07:31.370
she would have gone back home long ago.

07:32.600 --> 07:35.560
Don't you want to give it a try with her?

07:36.400 --> 07:37.380
Give it a shot.

07:47.640 --> 07:48.580
Look.

07:48.659 --> 07:50.409
Look at the rain.

07:50.430 --> 07:51.610
This, this, this...

07:51.630 --> 07:52.920
It's getting damaged.

07:52.940 --> 07:53.659
Yeah.

07:55.159 --> 07:56.780
Once the rainy season hit,

07:56.810 --> 07:58.820
those few intern college students

07:59.110 --> 07:59.960
all left.

08:00.860 --> 08:01.780
Chen Rui is the best.

08:01.810 --> 08:02.730
Look how reliable he is.

08:02.840 --> 08:03.760
Indeed.

08:04.530 --> 08:05.370
Rui.

08:07.050 --> 08:08.590
Coming. Wait for me.

08:08.610 --> 08:10.060
Have you made any new discoveries?

08:10.750 --> 08:11.810
Here's the thing.

08:15.540 --> 08:16.830
These past couple of days,

08:16.860 --> 08:18.470
I just sent an email to the local

08:18.470 --> 08:19.910
cultural department in Verona.

08:19.930 --> 08:21.290
But they haven't replied to me yet.

08:21.330 --> 08:23.730
So I looked it up on their foreign website.

08:23.750 --> 08:24.580
During the Qing Dynasty,

08:24.670 --> 08:26.110
there were indeed quite a few merchant ships

08:26.110 --> 08:28.510
traveling between China and Italy.

08:28.530 --> 08:30.610
Some documents were destroyed during World War II.

08:30.640 --> 08:32.880
However, some customs records still remain.

08:32.909 --> 08:34.440
I think we can look into it.

08:34.980 --> 08:37.230
We still need to know who those families are.

08:38.190 --> 08:39.140
Thank you.

08:39.169 --> 08:40.110
Be careful.

08:40.970 --> 08:43.500
Don't we already know this?

08:43.539 --> 08:44.710
Little Polo, right?

08:45.030 --> 08:45.850
Mr. Zhou

08:46.180 --> 08:48.940
the name Polo is very common in Italy.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.480
It's like in our country,

08:50.560 --> 08:53.230
if you go to the police station to look for someone named Wang Jianguo.

08:53.310 --> 08:54.630
If you only know the person is called Wang Jianguo

08:54.630 --> 08:55.570
and nothing else,

08:55.610 --> 08:56.770
it would be exhausting to search.

08:56.800 --> 08:57.650
Yes.

08:57.670 --> 08:58.720
I have an idea.

08:58.740 --> 08:59.790
Don't a few families

08:59.830 --> 09:01.590
in the notebook have surnames?

09:01.600 --> 09:02.960
Let's start with the

09:02.990 --> 09:04.510
county records and family genealogies along the canal.

09:04.530 --> 09:06.160
We can look for some clues.

09:06.500 --> 09:07.250
Right.

09:07.330 --> 09:09.240
Let's start by investigating our own families first.

09:09.310 --> 09:10.120
I remember

09:10.160 --> 09:11.660
our family has a genealogy book.

09:11.820 --> 09:13.290
Let me make a call to my hometown

09:13.330 --> 09:15.120
and ask them to make a copy and send it over.

09:15.150 --> 09:16.840
Just the genealogy book might not be enough.

09:17.020 --> 09:18.770
Let's also check if there are

09:18.820 --> 09:20.380
any related old items in our own homes.

09:20.770 --> 09:22.760
Like the old silver coins in our family.

09:22.870 --> 09:24.270
We also have a shoehorn at home.

09:26.190 --> 09:28.270
Ask your mom to check her side of the family.

09:30.370 --> 09:32.230
But because of her work,

09:32.250 --> 09:33.540
she moves a lot.

09:34.230 --> 09:36.410
They might not have been able to keep old items.

09:37.930 --> 09:40.250
I remember Xingchi told me

09:40.270 --> 09:42.220
that the Xie family has a small wine flask, right?

09:42.810 --> 09:44.800
The Xia family has one with a foreign language too.

09:45.420 --> 09:46.990
Xingchi knows about it too?

09:47.400 --> 09:48.820
We talked about it in Beijing.

09:48.850 --> 09:49.970
He was so excited when he heard about it.

09:50.030 --> 09:51.250
Said he'd give us great credit for it.

09:53.590 --> 09:55.330
Did he say when he'll be back?

09:56.720 --> 09:57.900
No, he didn't mention that.

10:05.960 --> 10:07.380
Well, whatever.

10:08.460 --> 10:10.360
Let's see how long he can hang in there for.

10:11.030 --> 10:12.080
The kids have grown up.

10:12.120 --> 10:13.120
Don't force them.

10:13.590 --> 10:15.110
If parents are too strict,

10:15.690 --> 10:16.850
it's easy to create resentment.

10:17.950 --> 10:19.310
If he could be sensible

10:19.350 --> 10:20.480
like Chen Rui or Haikuo,

10:20.480 --> 10:21.640
I wouldn't worry.

10:21.860 --> 10:24.190
As long as he doesn't cause trouble, I'm content.

10:24.220 --> 10:26.110
Even if he stays at home all day,

10:26.110 --> 10:27.270
doing nothing,

10:27.300 --> 10:29.010
I'll be happy if he just lies around at home.

10:40.470 --> 10:42.440
Shipping has resumed.

10:42.480 --> 10:45.320
When can Boss Xie return to the river?

10:53.600 --> 10:54.560
Master Zhou!

10:56.210 --> 10:57.070
Ms. Bian.

10:57.840 --> 10:58.780
What brings you here?

11:00.550 --> 11:01.600
Do you have a moment?

11:01.630 --> 11:03.220
I'd like to take up a few minutes of your time.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.710
I have time.

11:04.860 --> 11:07.270
You taught me a few quick dishes last time, right?

11:07.350 --> 11:10.030
I tried them at home, but they didn't turn out well.

11:11.280 --> 11:12.500
Why not?

11:12.540 --> 11:14.010
It just didn't taste good.

11:14.420 --> 11:16.220
I was wondering if

11:16.270 --> 11:17.750
there was something wrong with my method.

11:17.770 --> 11:19.130
I bought some groceries again today.

11:19.190 --> 11:20.000
Please teach me.

11:20.020 --> 11:21.570
Could you demonstrate it for me once?

11:23.560 --> 11:25.030
Listen, Ms. Bian,

11:25.460 --> 11:27.400
you're underestimating the complexity of cooking.

11:28.430 --> 11:29.850
It's not that simple.

11:29.880 --> 11:31.130
You need to learn gradually,

11:31.160 --> 11:32.570
practice little by little.

11:32.840 --> 11:35.010
When I first started learning to cook, it was the same for me.

11:35.030 --> 11:36.220
My food wasn't good either.

11:36.240 --> 11:37.320
I had to learn too.

11:37.350 --> 11:39.600
I even had to find a master to teach me, right?

11:39.990 --> 11:41.850
Then let me become your apprentice.

11:41.880 --> 11:44.170
I've been really interested in cooking lately.

11:44.190 --> 11:45.390
Please teach me.

11:45.450 --> 11:47.210
I'm quite easy to teach.

11:53.090 --> 11:53.960
Ms. Bian,

11:54.860 --> 11:56.020
I think we should

11:56.050 --> 11:57.270
stop beating around the bush.

11:57.820 --> 11:59.080
Becoming an apprentice is fine,

11:59.110 --> 12:00.130
but

12:00.680 --> 12:02.060
I don't think we're a good match.

12:04.790 --> 12:05.430
Well...

12:05.460 --> 12:06.640
You haven't even tried.

12:06.670 --> 12:08.760
How do you know we're not suitable?

12:10.820 --> 12:12.640
There are many things about my situation that you might

12:12.650 --> 12:13.680
not be aware of.

12:14.390 --> 12:15.050
I

12:15.080 --> 12:16.270
still want to wait for her a bit longer.

12:17.680 --> 12:18.770
I know.

12:20.700 --> 12:22.760
But she's been gone for a long time.

12:24.540 --> 12:25.720
Master Zhou,

12:26.190 --> 12:27.600
I think

12:27.630 --> 12:29.910
you have the right to pursue your own happiness.

12:30.810 --> 12:31.670
Are you saying

12:31.690 --> 12:32.650
you plan

12:32.680 --> 12:34.320
to just keep waiting like this?

12:34.340 --> 12:35.730
Until when?

12:36.550 --> 12:37.490
Don't tell me

12:37.510 --> 12:38.950
you're going to wait your whole life.

12:43.090 --> 12:44.920
I don't know if I'll wait for my whole life or not,

12:44.960 --> 12:47.290
but I know if I stop waiting

12:48.360 --> 12:49.800
and she happens to come back,

12:50.600 --> 12:51.800
I'll definitely regret it.

12:55.880 --> 12:56.880
Understand?

13:01.270 --> 13:06.850
[Fenghua Express]

13:01.750 --> 13:02.630
He, you're back.

13:02.710 --> 13:03.630
Yes, I'm back.

13:03.630 --> 13:04.270
Are you okay?

13:04.270 --> 13:05.590
Is Auntie alright?

13:06.080 --> 13:07.110
I'm fine.

13:07.690 --> 13:09.460
It's nothing. Just a slight fracture, no big deal.

13:09.490 --> 13:10.280
It's okay.

13:10.310 --> 13:10.830
Come, come.

13:10.850 --> 13:11.890
Thank you, thank you.

13:11.930 --> 13:13.020
Go on with your work.

13:13.040 --> 13:13.830
Take it easy.

13:14.690 --> 13:15.620
Let me do it.

13:15.790 --> 13:16.820
Fenghua.

13:17.490 --> 13:18.820
Did you get all the medical checkups done?

13:18.860 --> 13:20.560
Yes, we had X-rays taken.

13:20.580 --> 13:21.660
It's nothing serious.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.470
X-rays can only show bones.

13:23.500 --> 13:24.710
You should've taken this opportunity

13:24.710 --> 13:26.150
to have a thorough physical examination.

13:26.170 --> 13:27.430
What's the point of a checkup?

13:27.450 --> 13:29.550
I'm as fit as a fiddle.

13:29.580 --> 13:30.920
You can't be too sure about that.

13:31.030 --> 13:32.080
When I was young,

13:32.110 --> 13:33.110
one of the neighbors in our courtyard,

13:33.140 --> 13:34.190
an old lady,

13:34.220 --> 13:36.130
she seemed fine normally,

13:36.270 --> 13:38.140
but one day, she suddenly had a stroke.

13:41.430 --> 13:42.440
That's not a very auspicious thing to say.

13:42.470 --> 13:43.170
Let's not talk about it anymore.

13:43.510 --> 13:44.590
Anyway, you need to be careful.

13:44.610 --> 13:46.370
Find some time to get a full physical examination.

13:46.840 --> 13:47.670
I got it, Fenghua.

13:47.700 --> 13:49.050
Go back to your work.

13:49.080 --> 13:49.380
Go.

13:49.380 --> 13:49.990
Will you be alright?

13:50.030 --> 13:50.950
Yes, yes, I'll be fine.

14:07.530 --> 14:08.970
Hello, Fenghua.

14:09.940 --> 14:10.750
Mom.

14:10.990 --> 14:12.290
What's wrong? Is something the matter?

14:14.670 --> 14:16.030
I miss Granny Ma.

14:18.520 --> 14:21.460
Could you burn some joss paper for her later?

14:21.800 --> 14:23.490
It's not Qingming Festival today.

14:23.710 --> 14:24.670
I insist.

14:24.710 --> 14:26.000
Alright, alright.

14:26.030 --> 14:27.070
I will.

14:27.470 --> 14:28.290
Don't use the paper money.

14:28.350 --> 14:29.520
I want the gold ingots.

14:29.930 --> 14:30.810
Take a basin.

14:30.840 --> 14:32.080
Go burn it at Granny's doorstep.

14:32.260 --> 14:33.510
Okay, okay, I got it.

14:33.550 --> 14:34.580
I'm cooking.

14:48.420 --> 14:49.480
Siyi.

14:50.870 --> 14:51.910
Where are you?

14:53.090 --> 14:54.140
I miss you so much.

15:10.860 --> 15:11.570
What?

15:13.870 --> 15:14.710
Work injury?

15:15.250 --> 15:15.770
Yes.

15:16.900 --> 15:17.670
This, this...

15:17.670 --> 15:19.080
That doesn't seem appropriate.

15:20.040 --> 15:21.560
What's inappropriate about it?

15:22.050 --> 15:24.170
You were injured while working, after all.

15:25.250 --> 15:26.620
Make the company pay a bit more.

15:27.030 --> 15:28.240
Our finances

15:28.440 --> 15:29.470
can ease up quite a bit.

15:30.310 --> 15:31.110
I mean...

15:31.110 --> 15:33.830
Ms. Xia has been good enough to us.

15:34.330 --> 15:36.600
We shouldn't cause trouble for her at this time.

15:37.150 --> 15:38.640
Fenghua has been good to us.

15:39.030 --> 15:40.920
That's because our family is willing to work hard.

15:41.030 --> 15:42.410
We're valuable to her.

15:42.490 --> 15:43.830
Why isn't she good to others then?

15:44.230 --> 15:45.710
Who isn't she good to?

15:46.590 --> 15:48.700
She's wholeheartedly devoted to everyone.

15:48.740 --> 15:51.010
What's the use of being so devoted?

15:51.340 --> 15:52.680
Yuanbao went to Bee.

15:52.710 --> 15:54.260
He's earning several thousand more a month.

15:54.280 --> 15:55.330
Then why don't you go?

15:57.640 --> 16:00.170
Who begged you to stay in the first place?

16:01.550 --> 16:03.070
We're talking about medical expenses here.

16:03.100 --> 16:04.180
Why bring up other things?

16:05.240 --> 16:06.560
He Tianming, let me tell you.

16:06.580 --> 16:08.140
Even close brothers keep their accounts clear.

16:08.200 --> 16:10.660
You have to work and help with management,

16:10.680 --> 16:12.560
but you earn so little and I can't even complain?

16:22.410 --> 16:23.110
Honey.

16:23.140 --> 16:23.890
Honey.

16:24.170 --> 16:25.130
Honey.

16:25.770 --> 16:27.240
Mom's sick.

16:27.990 --> 16:29.270
Let's go brew the medicine.

16:29.760 --> 16:30.520
Yes.

16:30.550 --> 16:31.350
You're right.

16:31.370 --> 16:33.450
Look at the state of our home.

16:34.650 --> 16:36.280
Our home is in such a state.

16:36.590 --> 16:38.270
We can't even afford to eat now.

16:38.270 --> 16:39.890
Why do you still care about friendship?

16:41.460 --> 16:44.530
♫What will you do without me♫

16:45.190 --> 16:48.650
♫Who will dry your tears?♫

16:49.400 --> 16:52.910
♫Who will hold up an umbrella and comfort you♫

16:52.660 --> 16:53.380
Who is it?

16:53.730 --> 16:55.820
Fenghua, are you asleep?

16:54.110 --> 16:57.530
♫You're afraid of loneliness on a sleepless night♫

16:58.690 --> 17:01.960
♫What will you do without me♫

17:02.460 --> 17:05.849
♫Who else knows what's on your mind?♫

17:05.890 --> 17:06.900
What's up?

17:06.680 --> 17:09.170
♫Why did you let go of me and leave♫

17:09.270 --> 17:09.960
Come in and talk.

17:09.990 --> 17:11.380
No, no. It's not necessary.

17:10.550 --> 17:16.740
♫Didn't we promised to love each other forever?♫

17:12.040 --> 17:13.680
Can my mom's injury be considered a work-related injury?

17:14.380 --> 17:15.819
Of course it is a work-related injury.

17:18.470 --> 17:19.619
I forgot to mention it.

17:19.829 --> 17:20.910
We've bought insurance.

17:20.940 --> 17:23.050
You basically don't need to pay this time.

17:24.740 --> 17:25.920
That's great!

17:26.160 --> 17:28.430
Then, about the medical expenses you paid in advance for my mom before...

17:28.450 --> 17:29.010
It's okay.

17:29.740 --> 17:31.540
We'll talk about that after the reimbursement is done.

17:32.430 --> 17:36.230
♫Don't look at me, I'm not crazy♫

17:32.470 --> 17:33.310
Is there anything else?

17:33.350 --> 17:34.060
Nothing else.

17:34.080 --> 17:34.810
Get some rest early.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.670
♫I'm just heartbroken♫

17:46.110 --> 17:49.310
♫Maybe if I wait, you'll come back♫

17:48.230 --> 17:49.750
Coming! Wait a moment.

17:50.050 --> 17:52.510
♫What will you do without me♫

17:53.670 --> 17:54.770
Give me a raise.

17:53.790 --> 17:57.150
♫Who will dry your tears?♫

17:54.950 --> 17:56.160
A thousand more per month would be fine.

17:56.750 --> 17:58.320
Yuanbao and Shen are working at Bee

17:58.100 --> 18:01.550
♫Who will hold the umbrella for you?♫

17:59.240 --> 18:00.750
and their salaries are over 10,000 now.

18:02.180 --> 18:03.300
What if I don't give you a raise?

18:03.900 --> 18:05.280
If I don't give you a raise,

18:05.300 --> 18:06.410
will you go to Bee?

18:07.990 --> 18:09.180
That won't happen.

18:14.290 --> 18:15.350
If you don't give me a raise...

18:15.390 --> 18:16.420
Bee pays more.

18:16.430 --> 18:17.600
Then go to Bee.

18:17.630 --> 18:18.430
I won't stop you.

18:19.090 --> 18:19.860
Go ahead.

18:19.900 --> 18:21.680
Take your mother and your wife with you.

18:21.700 --> 18:23.560
I can't afford to support idle people now.

18:39.790 --> 18:45.780
[Decline] [Answer]

18:39.790 --> 18:45.780
[Mother]

18:47.340 --> 18:48.650
[Decline] [Answer]

18:47.340 --> 18:48.650
[Mother]

19:02.010 --> 19:07.930
[What if employees want to quit?]

19:18.510 --> 19:22.420
Look at how much we've burdened Ms. Xia.

19:22.450 --> 19:25.850
How could you ask her for a raise?

19:25.880 --> 19:27.390
I just mentioned it.

19:27.420 --> 19:28.940
I didn't say it was necessary.

19:29.220 --> 19:30.090
Mom,

19:30.430 --> 19:31.960
he's working so hard there.

19:31.980 --> 19:33.220
Shut up.

19:34.550 --> 19:36.920
You must apologize to Ms. Xia.

19:36.930 --> 19:38.580
Just tell her we're not leaving.

19:38.610 --> 19:40.990
We have nowhere else to go.

19:41.120 --> 19:43.040
Who says we have nowhere to go?

19:43.220 --> 19:45.910
If she tells us to get lost, she'll have to pay compensation.

19:47.320 --> 19:48.380
With that money…

19:49.430 --> 19:50.030
With that money,

19:50.030 --> 19:51.480
we can rent a storefront.

19:51.500 --> 19:52.790
Tianming can do food delivery,

19:52.810 --> 19:54.600
and the two of us can rent a storefront.

19:54.780 --> 19:56.960
Then we can be our own bosses.

19:58.850 --> 20:00.370
Mom.

20:05.610 --> 20:07.280
I know.

20:07.300 --> 20:09.610
You think I'm nagging.

20:09.650 --> 20:11.530
You find me troublesome.

20:13.230 --> 20:16.380
You won't listen to me anymore.

20:19.740 --> 20:21.760
From now on, don't listen to me.

20:21.780 --> 20:23.470
You choose

20:23.870 --> 20:25.550
your own path.

20:33.160 --> 20:38.660
[Fenghua Express]

21:01.250 --> 21:01.840
Fenghua,

21:02.820 --> 21:03.510
I'm sorry.

21:07.550 --> 21:08.930
You don't need to give me a raise.

21:09.910 --> 21:10.990
Just pretend I never said anything.

21:13.060 --> 21:14.580
How did you come to this decision?

21:14.980 --> 21:15.720
My mom said...

21:15.740 --> 21:17.150
I don't want to hear what your mom said.

21:17.390 --> 21:18.710
I want to hear your thoughts.

21:21.610 --> 21:22.870
I was blinded by money.

21:23.200 --> 21:24.140
I'm sorry.

21:25.840 --> 21:27.110
Don't say that.

21:27.980 --> 21:29.640
The industry hasn't been doing well lately.

21:29.670 --> 21:30.720
I really can't give a raise.

21:31.130 --> 21:32.810
Otherwise, I can't explain it to the headquarters.

21:32.840 --> 21:33.560
I know.

21:35.330 --> 21:36.360
You've done more than enough

21:36.530 --> 21:37.680
for my family.

21:38.610 --> 21:39.610
My mom,

21:39.750 --> 21:40.530
my wife…

21:41.120 --> 21:42.000
If it were someone else,

21:43.030 --> 21:44.580
they would have been kicked out long ago.

21:44.600 --> 21:45.910
They're not idle either.

21:46.820 --> 21:48.490
I know you're under a lot of pressure.

21:48.590 --> 21:50.420
You want to save more money for your child.

21:50.550 --> 21:51.790
The child is one thing.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.160
It's also about my mom.

21:56.260 --> 21:57.550
Living with me,

21:59.150 --> 22:00.730
not only hasn't she had a good life,

22:01.100 --> 22:03.290
but she almost didn't have a place to live.

22:05.050 --> 22:06.840
She works all day for me,

22:08.700 --> 22:09.660
and when she gets sick,

22:09.680 --> 22:11.200
I don't even have the money for medical treatment.

22:13.740 --> 22:15.400
I feel like I'm such an unfilial son.

22:24.310 --> 22:25.150
Alright.

22:27.350 --> 22:28.390
Go to Bee.

22:31.180 --> 22:32.830
Your mom and your wife can stay.

22:33.830 --> 22:34.530
Fenghua.

22:34.710 --> 22:36.010
You're here,

22:36.140 --> 22:37.340
but your heart has run away.

22:37.990 --> 22:38.990
You won't do well here either.

22:40.070 --> 22:41.280
You might as well go out and try.

22:41.310 --> 22:42.490
That's not what I meant.

22:42.510 --> 22:44.250
Enough. No need to explain.

22:44.660 --> 22:46.300
If you want to go, then go.

22:46.580 --> 22:47.870
A grown man

22:47.890 --> 22:49.500
supporting his family is nothing to be ashamed of.

22:49.910 --> 22:52.420
If you go to Bee and see Xie Wanghe later,

22:53.010 --> 22:55.530
throw a pebble in his sandals for me.

22:55.690 --> 22:56.800
When he eats instant noodles,

22:57.060 --> 22:58.180
throw away his seasoning packet.

23:10.350 --> 23:11.350
Old Mr. Zhou,

23:11.390 --> 23:12.550
good morning.

23:13.000 --> 23:13.600
Thank you.

23:13.630 --> 23:14.830
You haven't had breakfast, have you?

23:14.830 --> 23:15.030
Thank you.

23:15.030 --> 23:16.160
Have a bowl of hot tofu pudding.

23:16.300 --> 23:17.700
Thank you, thank you.

23:17.750 --> 23:18.720
Um,

23:18.880 --> 23:19.710
Does Mr. Zhou

23:19.890 --> 23:21.010
have time recently?

23:21.030 --> 23:21.870
Yes.

23:22.350 --> 23:23.270
What's the matter?

23:24.030 --> 23:25.780
Remember that Ms. Bian from last time?

23:25.800 --> 23:27.070
He didn't like her, right?

23:27.110 --> 23:28.050
Well,

23:28.070 --> 23:29.640
I have found another one for him.

23:29.670 --> 23:32.240
She runs her own company in the city.

23:32.470 --> 23:34.580
She's capable in business and is beautiful too.

23:34.670 --> 23:35.950
Her age is also suitable.

23:36.100 --> 23:37.680
How about we

23:37.830 --> 23:38.670
meet her sometime?

23:41.110 --> 23:42.250
We'll see.

23:43.470 --> 23:45.010
I think

23:45.040 --> 23:46.920
Yanlin isn't very interested in this matter.

23:47.240 --> 23:48.680
Why is that?

23:49.470 --> 23:52.250
He probably hasn't moved on his heart.

23:53.050 --> 23:54.150
Let him be.

23:56.270 --> 23:57.260
Yanlin is

23:57.280 --> 23:57.880
stubborn.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.790
He doesn't listen to anyone.

24:03.760 --> 24:05.640
I'll ask Granny Ma to persuade him later.

24:08.440 --> 24:09.360
Granny Ma?

24:09.990 --> 24:11.570
Before, when Yanlin

24:11.720 --> 24:13.550
had a falling out with that Zhimei,

24:13.760 --> 24:15.630
it was Granny Ma who reconciled them.

24:18.300 --> 24:19.530
I'll find her later

24:19.840 --> 24:21.110
to persuade Yanlin.

24:24.490 --> 24:26.760
If you arrange more matches,

24:26.900 --> 24:28.400
let Granny Ma take a look too.

24:29.400 --> 24:30.600
She's good at judging people.

24:49.190 --> 24:51.340
Who's in charge of the Haidian District's business now?

24:51.870 --> 24:53.280
The data that we worked so hard to improve

24:53.310 --> 24:54.860
has dropped so much.

24:54.950 --> 24:56.180
It's my oversight.

24:56.450 --> 24:57.560
For this week's requirements,

24:57.630 --> 24:59.330
I assigned them to two of Mr. Xie's subordinates.

24:59.450 --> 25:00.710
They're still in the adjustment period.

25:00.710 --> 25:02.070
Are they adjusting or just slacking off?

25:03.290 --> 25:03.990
Go

25:04.130 --> 25:05.920
and tell those two to come see me now.

25:06.760 --> 25:07.610
Now!

25:08.500 --> 25:09.250
Alright.

25:21.170 --> 25:22.800
Mr. Meng, they've arrived.

25:26.510 --> 25:27.270
Mr. Meng.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.510
What's going on?

25:33.330 --> 25:34.500
I'm sorry, Mr. Meng.

25:34.980 --> 25:35.990
It's my fault.

25:36.190 --> 25:36.980
If you want to fire someone, fire me.

25:37.020 --> 25:37.940
Fire you?

25:38.720 --> 25:39.760
Who do you think you are?

25:39.910 --> 25:41.510
Would firing you solve the problem?

25:41.530 --> 25:42.970
Mr. Meng, I think

25:43.120 --> 25:44.620
our strategy for dealing with Yuntu's subsidy war

25:44.660 --> 25:45.660
still needs optimization.

25:45.710 --> 25:46.740
Who's in charge of the strategy?

25:54.620 --> 25:56.800
What's going on with Xie Wanghe?

25:56.990 --> 25:58.550
He went to Tianjin.

25:58.740 --> 25:59.620
His father is in the hospital.

26:01.100 --> 26:01.860
What for?

26:02.810 --> 26:04.840
Wanghe's father was stabbed while trying to help someone.

26:04.870 --> 26:06.590
He's under observation in the hospital now.

26:09.470 --> 26:10.650
Is his life in danger?

26:11.780 --> 26:12.550
No.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.110
Go.

26:18.340 --> 26:19.970
Call Xie Wanghe and tell him to come back.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.460
Tell him to come back today.

26:21.480 --> 26:22.790
If he doesn't come back today,

26:22.830 --> 26:24.180
don't ever come back!

26:25.990 --> 26:27.140
Go!

26:34.710 --> 26:37.720
[Tianjin Taxi]

26:47.300 --> 26:48.050
Mr. Meng.

26:48.480 --> 26:49.200
Come in.

26:53.190 --> 27:03.460
[Data Center]

26:54.950 --> 26:56.500
Why has it dropped so sharply?

27:02.350 --> 27:03.380
How's your father doing?

27:04.900 --> 27:06.990
He'll be discharged after two days of observation.

27:07.950 --> 27:08.890
I'm sorry,

27:09.150 --> 27:10.080
I left in a hurry.

27:10.180 --> 27:11.290
I didn't ask for leave.

27:12.290 --> 27:20.600
[Data Center]

27:12.750 --> 27:14.700
Did you think that if you told me about this,

27:14.700 --> 27:15.710
I wouldn't let you go?

27:16.060 --> 27:16.830
That's not it.

27:16.860 --> 27:17.740
Then why?

27:18.100 --> 27:19.630
Your father's hospitalization is such a big deal,

27:19.630 --> 27:20.670
yet you didn't even tell me.

27:20.940 --> 27:22.400
If you had told me immediately.

27:22.430 --> 27:23.710
I could have helped you arrange things.

27:23.730 --> 27:25.500
I have connections in Tianjin too.

27:25.630 --> 27:26.650
It's really not necessary.

27:27.890 --> 27:34.170
[Data Center]

27:28.780 --> 27:30.270
I'm very angry about this.

27:30.410 --> 27:32.300
I feel like you don't consider me as one of your own.

27:34.330 --> 27:35.200
Mr. Meng,

27:35.230 --> 27:37.180
I just left in a bit of a hurry.

27:37.220 --> 27:38.500
I didn't think it through.

27:48.330 --> 27:49.130
In the future,

27:49.540 --> 27:50.910
if you encounter any difficulties,

27:50.940 --> 27:52.460
you must tell me immediately.

27:52.500 --> 27:53.870
You should only try to figure it out on your own

27:53.870 --> 27:55.150
if I can't think of a solution.

27:59.170 --> 27:59.850
Have a seat.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.990
This time,

28:08.740 --> 28:11.110
your two guys still showed their inexperience.

28:14.970 --> 28:16.030
The two of them

28:16.270 --> 28:17.340
don't have much

28:17.380 --> 28:18.710
entrepreneurial experience.

28:19.020 --> 28:20.170
They're still a bit green.

28:20.190 --> 28:21.570
Yuntu is pushing hard.

28:22.130 --> 28:22.850
with subsidies

28:22.990 --> 28:24.550
and shorter delivery times.

28:24.800 --> 28:26.560
The upcoming battle will be tough.

28:26.590 --> 28:28.740
We can't keep up with the subsidies anymore.

28:28.860 --> 28:30.100
They just raised funds.

28:30.140 --> 28:31.800
They're hoping to force us to burn money.

28:33.810 --> 28:36.260
Then the only option left is to shorten the delivery time.

28:36.430 --> 28:38.180
We've already reached our limit.

28:38.470 --> 28:40.940
Didn't you say you could change to motorcycles?

28:44.440 --> 28:45.410
It's still not feasible.

28:45.550 --> 28:46.600
It's too dangerous.

28:46.720 --> 28:47.850
If something goes wrong,

28:47.880 --> 28:48.760
the risks outweigh the benefits.

28:54.020 --> 28:55.070
Wanghe,

28:55.190 --> 28:56.720
it's been almost three years since you graduated, right?

28:59.700 --> 29:01.900
Since it's been almost three years,

29:02.040 --> 29:04.080
you should understand what society is

29:04.110 --> 29:05.610
and what a company is by now.

29:06.590 --> 29:08.270
A company

29:08.800 --> 29:10.760
is like a machine,

29:10.820 --> 29:11.940
a precisely

29:12.070 --> 29:13.750
structured machine

29:13.780 --> 29:15.550
that runs on schedule.

29:16.280 --> 29:17.160
Therefore, it cannot tolerate

29:17.190 --> 29:19.210
any part malfunctioning.

29:19.240 --> 29:20.800
But the parts aren't malfunctioning now.

29:20.820 --> 29:22.620
Not keeping up with the machine's operating intensity

29:22.670 --> 29:24.030
doesn't count as malfunctioning?

29:24.060 --> 29:25.400
At 8,000 RPM,

29:25.420 --> 29:27.090
the bearings start smoking.

29:27.110 --> 29:28.540
We need to find a solution.

29:29.340 --> 29:30.400
Either fix it

29:30.710 --> 29:31.590
or replace it.

29:33.150 --> 29:35.290
We can't wait until the machine stops

29:35.580 --> 29:37.010
to reflect on it.

29:48.270 --> 29:48.830
Mr. Xie.

29:48.870 --> 29:49.490
Hello, Mr. Xie.

29:54.640 --> 29:55.760
Got scolded?

29:55.790 --> 29:56.470
No.

29:58.830 --> 30:00.310
Then why do you look so deflated?

30:03.420 --> 30:04.800
Have Song and Qiu Lin

30:05.550 --> 30:07.050
done anything these past couple of days?

30:08.700 --> 30:10.180
Just some grumbling,

30:10.200 --> 30:12.740
saying you left without notice,

30:12.900 --> 30:15.110
that you don't care about the company, and such.

30:15.470 --> 30:18.050
Basically, they've labeled you as unprofessional.

30:19.040 --> 30:20.590
That's all they're capable of.

30:20.750 --> 30:23.260
When I was canvassing, I heard from Yuntu's sales rep that

30:23.280 --> 30:24.850
they've got a new

30:24.870 --> 30:25.960
high-performance server.

30:26.460 --> 30:27.670
The program is being upgraded

30:27.690 --> 30:28.710
and will be online soon.

30:29.710 --> 30:31.120
What's online isn't important.

30:32.420 --> 30:34.330
The key is the offline delivery speed.

30:37.300 --> 30:38.140
However,

30:38.140 --> 30:39.460
in terms of the app,

30:40.090 --> 30:43.210
Yuntu's user experience is indeed better than Bee's.

30:43.230 --> 30:44.530
Then change it.

30:44.760 --> 30:46.060
Who's stopping you?

30:46.550 --> 30:47.810
I'm by myself.

30:47.830 --> 30:49.790
Yuntuan has over a dozen people just on the UI team.

30:49.820 --> 30:51.320
And they're all from big companies.

30:53.910 --> 30:55.900
If you have ideas, write them down first.

30:56.200 --> 30:57.880
I'll immediately give feedback to the programming department.

30:57.920 --> 30:58.940
Haikuo wrote it.

30:58.960 --> 31:00.860
He submitted it, but there's been no response at all.

31:00.900 --> 31:02.380
If there's no response, then follow up.

31:02.400 --> 31:03.770
We're nobodies.

31:03.800 --> 31:05.100
What right do we have to push them?

31:05.120 --> 31:07.120
The programming department acts like they're all big shots.

31:10.380 --> 31:12.110
Do I have to handle everything myself?

31:12.840 --> 31:14.410
What are you two here for then?

31:14.430 --> 31:15.640
Should I canvass for you?

31:15.700 --> 31:17.140
Should I code for you?

31:17.510 --> 31:19.200
Maybe I should collect your salaries for you too?

31:26.820 --> 31:28.430
The delivery time

31:28.840 --> 31:29.970
needs to be shortened further.

31:30.430 --> 31:31.770
How is that possible?

31:32.030 --> 31:34.670
How do you know it's impossible if you haven't tried?

31:35.130 --> 31:36.750
We've already shortened the delivery time

31:36.790 --> 31:37.830
by five minutes.

31:37.860 --> 31:40.360
That's all squeezed out of the delivery riders.

31:42.840 --> 31:43.900
Squeezed?

31:45.180 --> 31:47.110
Are they not earning more money?

31:47.500 --> 31:49.430
Did I force them to work overtime?

31:50.130 --> 31:51.970
Cut the crap.

31:52.810 --> 31:54.750
If you want to do it, do it. If not, get lost!

32:07.400 --> 32:08.590
What does he mean?

32:08.620 --> 32:09.960
What's he trying to say?

32:11.390 --> 32:13.230
He was talking about the delivery riders, not you.

32:13.400 --> 32:15.450
As if I'm willing to work for him?

32:15.480 --> 32:17.130
Let's go home first, come on.

32:50.380 --> 32:52.590
[Fenghua Express]

32:50.510 --> 32:51.260
Zhu,

32:51.660 --> 32:52.950
there are a few urgent orders here.

32:52.670 --> 32:53.840
[Loading Area]

32:52.980 --> 32:54.010
Please deliver them tonight.

32:54.670 --> 32:55.560
I'll put it here.

32:55.580 --> 32:57.340
Sister Hua, could you grab that package for me?

32:58.660 --> 33:00.410
Fenghua, there are still so many orders.

33:00.590 --> 33:01.780
We can't keep up at all.

33:01.780 --> 33:03.170
We haven't even eaten yet.

33:02.650 --> 33:06.730
[Fenghua Express]

33:03.410 --> 33:04.030
It's okay.

33:04.030 --> 33:05.410
You finish up and have dinner first.

33:05.430 --> 33:06.250
I'll deliver them.

33:09.040 --> 33:10.390
[Loading Area]

33:12.450 --> 33:13.380
Wanghe?

33:17.180 --> 33:18.090
Wanghe!

33:26.930 --> 33:28.240
What's the meaning of this?

33:28.390 --> 33:29.720
You came here and didn't say anything.

33:29.800 --> 33:31.150
Are you playing undercover or something?

33:37.030 --> 33:38.810
Still a fan of Chris Lee, huh?

33:39.250 --> 33:40.220
You're quite loyal.

33:40.320 --> 33:41.160
You think

33:41.200 --> 33:42.240
everyone's like you?

33:48.290 --> 33:49.240
What are you doing here?

33:53.350 --> 33:54.150
Just passing by.

33:55.500 --> 33:56.470
Passing by?

33:57.630 --> 33:59.110
From where to where?

33:59.150 --> 34:00.370
How could you possibly be passing by here?

34:01.000 --> 34:02.370
Are you my boss?

34:02.390 --> 34:04.080
Do I need to report to you where I go?

34:06.030 --> 34:06.910
Fine, don't tell me.

34:13.270 --> 34:14.070
They pissed me off.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.440
Who?

34:17.989 --> 34:19.630
Those two pissed me off.

34:20.719 --> 34:21.650
You piss me off too.

34:23.040 --> 34:24.389
How did I piss you off?

34:24.389 --> 34:25.679
Don't falsely accuse me.

34:25.900 --> 34:27.280
I rarely come here.

34:28.030 --> 34:29.510
You won't even offer me a cup of tea.

34:32.909 --> 34:33.840
You don't deserve it.

34:34.580 --> 34:35.909
Did I offend you or something?

34:35.929 --> 34:37.810
The employees I worked so hard to train

34:38.699 --> 34:39.889
have all been taken away by you.

34:40.550 --> 34:41.850
You think you're so great just because you're rich, huh?

34:43.540 --> 34:44.719
It's not me.

34:45.400 --> 34:47.070
It's market demand.

34:47.679 --> 34:50.260
The volume of food delivery orders is much larger than that of express delivery.

34:50.469 --> 34:52.730
It's normal for people to go where

34:52.870 --> 34:53.989
the wage is higher.

35:00.270 --> 35:02.320
I heard your company is going public.

35:04.380 --> 35:06.390
Next year, if things go well.

35:07.710 --> 35:08.970
Congratulations, then.

35:11.980 --> 35:13.810
Going public is just the first step.

35:15.020 --> 35:16.890
The real challenge comes after that.

35:17.330 --> 35:19.160
We have to fight to the bitter end.

35:19.300 --> 35:21.150
We need to dominate this market,

35:21.460 --> 35:22.560
and become the sole leader,

35:22.590 --> 35:23.800
for us to catch a breath.

35:25.700 --> 35:26.940
When you reach that point,

35:27.890 --> 35:29.340
you should be very rich, right?

35:29.950 --> 35:31.370
Money doesn't matter.

35:31.430 --> 35:32.590
It just needs to be enough to spend.

35:33.550 --> 35:34.790
What I want is industry status.

35:36.700 --> 35:37.970
Many years from now,

35:38.550 --> 35:39.600
I want to look back to today

35:39.830 --> 35:41.070
and find that I, Xie Wanghe,

35:42.290 --> 35:44.390
have made a contribution to this world.

35:53.370 --> 35:54.010
What?

35:54.750 --> 35:55.560
You don't believe me?

35:56.230 --> 35:57.090
I do believe you.

35:59.710 --> 36:01.890
You've always dreamed of the future.

36:02.720 --> 36:04.590
I had doubts before,

36:05.450 --> 36:07.450
but mostly, I wish you well.

36:09.230 --> 36:11.070
I think if you really made it big,

36:11.090 --> 36:12.240
you could help us out.

36:12.660 --> 36:14.610
Even if there were no real benefits,

36:14.830 --> 36:16.010
we could at least brag about it.

36:18.510 --> 36:19.760
You know Xie Wanghe, right?

36:20.430 --> 36:21.300
He's my childhood friend.

36:21.680 --> 36:22.800
We lived across from each other.

36:22.980 --> 36:24.940
We could even hear each other sleep talking at night.

36:25.520 --> 36:27.890
Alright, I'll work hard then.

36:28.200 --> 36:30.930
In the future, if you get drunk at a dinner party,

36:31.100 --> 36:32.420
just video call me.

36:32.670 --> 36:33.740
I'll definitely answer.

36:34.190 --> 36:35.630
I'll greet each of them.

36:35.650 --> 36:36.820
You'll definitely look impressive.

36:37.270 --> 36:38.390
That day will never come.

36:40.190 --> 36:40.880
Why?

36:44.200 --> 36:46.550
I need to stay away from a company that doesn't treat

36:47.500 --> 36:48.690
its employees as human beings.

36:49.090 --> 36:50.130
Or else I'll have bad karma.

36:53.290 --> 36:54.710
Did they call you?

36:54.740 --> 36:56.000
I don't need them to tell me.

36:57.330 --> 36:58.560
Anyone can see

36:58.590 --> 36:59.990
Bee's performance

37:00.130 --> 37:01.520
this past half year.

37:03.450 --> 37:05.160
Let me say something harsh.

37:05.200 --> 37:07.820
Even Emperor Qin building the Great Wall wasn't as ruthless as you.

37:14.970 --> 37:16.750
Capital has its demands.

37:17.750 --> 37:20.520
Once we've raised funds, we must expand rapidly.

37:20.580 --> 37:21.790
We need to seize the market.

37:21.880 --> 37:23.400
The market is only so big.

37:23.500 --> 37:24.670
If we don't grab it,

37:24.690 --> 37:26.140
others will survive instead.

37:26.160 --> 37:27.070
I don't want to become

37:27.070 --> 37:28.350
a stepping stone for others' success.

37:28.350 --> 37:29.590
You won't be.

37:29.930 --> 37:32.150
You already have the potential for success.

37:33.190 --> 37:33.910
Cold-bloodedness.

37:37.910 --> 37:39.310
You say that too?

37:39.380 --> 37:40.750
What do you all mean?

37:40.830 --> 37:41.980
Don't be angry.

37:42.780 --> 37:43.900
I'm not insulting you.

37:44.310 --> 37:45.410
I'm praising you.

37:46.130 --> 37:48.880
All you've ever thought about since childhood was success.

37:49.990 --> 37:51.230
I guess you got what you wanted.

38:18.610 --> 38:20.410
Then what do you think I should do?

38:21.160 --> 38:22.220
Increase the commission?

38:22.270 --> 38:23.080
Reduce pressure?

38:23.240 --> 38:24.570
Should I be a philanthropist

38:24.600 --> 38:26.140
and have everyone wait to die together?

38:30.710 --> 38:31.920
I don't care about others,

38:32.380 --> 38:33.910
but don't be too harsh

38:34.780 --> 38:35.650
on my old employees.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.670
Don't just drink.

39:19.740 --> 39:20.740
Eat something.

39:23.760 --> 39:24.760
He's under a lot of pressure too.

39:24.780 --> 39:26.150
Who isn't under pressure?

39:26.170 --> 39:27.270
When I resigned,

39:27.290 --> 39:29.750
Xiaohui disagreed with it from the bottom of her heart.

39:29.780 --> 39:31.170
Why did she disagree?

39:31.190 --> 39:32.810
For startup companies,

39:32.830 --> 39:33.870
only one or two

39:33.900 --> 39:36.550
in the same category can survive in the end.

39:36.650 --> 39:37.920
Bee just raised its Series C funding,

39:37.940 --> 39:39.500
but the money is almost burned through.

39:39.530 --> 39:41.270
If it's burned through, just raise Series D then.

39:41.400 --> 39:43.450
You think raising funds is that easy?

39:43.510 --> 39:45.350
Each round dilutes the shares.

39:45.370 --> 39:46.980
When shares are diluted to a certain extent,

39:47.010 --> 39:48.130
and you can't go public,

39:48.160 --> 39:49.610
you can only sell to a big company.

39:49.640 --> 39:51.420
By then, the management will all be replaced.

39:51.610 --> 39:52.750
Wanghe has equity.

39:52.790 --> 39:54.510
Even if Bee is acquired, he won't lose out.

40:01.660 --> 40:03.010
I know you want to talk about us two.

40:03.040 --> 40:04.160
That's not what I meant.

40:06.860 --> 40:08.570
You had a proper career before,

40:08.600 --> 40:09.770
so you feel like you've lost out.

40:09.800 --> 40:10.970
I had nothing,

40:11.020 --> 40:12.430
so even if we fail,

40:12.430 --> 40:13.980
I don't feel like I've lost anything.

40:14.390 --> 40:15.960
We have different mindsets.

40:18.300 --> 40:19.360
I just feel that...

40:22.680 --> 40:23.930
Wanghe has changed.

40:24.170 --> 40:25.070
That's normal.

40:28.610 --> 40:29.790
Before, we were brothers.

40:29.810 --> 40:30.970
Now, he's the boss.

40:31.320 --> 40:32.890
We look at issues from different angles.

40:33.750 --> 40:35.400
So what if he's the boss?

40:35.840 --> 40:38.360
Does being a boss mean he can be unreasonable?

40:38.480 --> 40:40.750
Can he just run his mouth without any consideration?

40:40.780 --> 40:42.200
If this was back in the day,

40:42.210 --> 40:43.350
someone like Wanghe would…

40:43.480 --> 40:44.320
Enough.

40:44.350 --> 40:45.760
Has your grandpa's spirit possessed you?

40:54.640 --> 40:56.140
I really want to go to his house right now.

40:56.420 --> 40:57.240
What for?

40:57.370 --> 40:57.920
I...

40:59.600 --> 41:01.190
I... I want to stuff chewed gum

41:01.190 --> 41:02.610
into his keyhole.

41:03.040 --> 41:03.840
I…

41:03.940 --> 41:04.630
I'll go too.

41:04.660 --> 41:05.740
I'll put cockroaches

41:05.760 --> 41:07.400
in his bed sheet and quilt cover,

41:07.430 --> 41:08.840
and pull out the fuse.

41:17.190 --> 41:18.490
Eat something.

41:20.030 --> 41:21.140
Boss!

41:21.690 --> 41:22.760
Give me a pig brain.

41:22.790 --> 41:23.570
Sure thing!

41:23.600 --> 41:25.940
Nourish your brain and appease Xiaohui.

41:44.030 --> 41:44.720
Open the door.

41:44.740 --> 41:45.270
Who is it?

41:45.300 --> 41:46.810
It's me, your dear old dad.

41:47.140 --> 41:47.940
My dear old dad?

41:47.960 --> 41:49.250
We don't have anyone like that here.

41:49.360 --> 41:51.200
Cut the crap and open the door.

41:51.230 --> 41:52.470
I'm holding in my pee.

41:53.390 --> 41:54.270
Apologize.

41:54.750 --> 41:55.950
What should I apologize for?

41:56.510 --> 41:58.470
"If you want to do it, do it. If not, get lost."

41:58.500 --> 41:59.690
Who said that?

42:00.060 --> 42:01.850
I wasn't talking about you guys.

42:01.880 --> 42:02.730
That won't do.

42:02.780 --> 42:04.600
Haikuo and I are both law-abiding citizens.

42:04.710 --> 42:05.950
We don't associate with reactionary bullies,

42:05.950 --> 42:07.390
landlords, or capitalists.

42:07.420 --> 42:08.540
Are you going to open it or not?

42:08.840 --> 42:10.260
What can you do if I don't?

42:15.650 --> 42:17.090
What are you doing?

42:21.650 --> 42:22.670
Stop it.

42:23.640 --> 42:24.670
Are you crazy?

42:40.890 --> 42:42.210
My bladder was about to burst.

42:48.690 --> 42:50.570
You really drank the Latour?

42:51.860 --> 42:53.490
What's Latour?

42:53.510 --> 42:54.830
Do you know?

42:55.390 --> 42:56.010
I don't know.

42:56.040 --> 42:57.140
Never heard of it.

42:57.970 --> 42:59.610
Not a drop left for me.

43:04.470 --> 43:06.230
You're sitting on my leg.
